WEBVTT

00:09:30.924 --> 00:09:34.640
They are so proximate to our humanity.

00:09:35.688 --> 00:09:37.839
They know that at the end of the day,

00:09:37.863 --> 00:09:40.967
these are people
who are part of families --

00:09:40.991 --> 00:09:42.852
someone's mother,

00:09:42.876 --> 00:09:45.127
someone's grandmother,

00:09:45.151 --> 00:09:47.601
someone's best friend

00:09:47.625 --> 00:09:49.765
and someone's baby;

00:09:51.773 --> 00:09:53.878
undeniably human,

00:09:54.656 --> 00:09:57.747
and therefore, not disposable.

00:09:59.715 --> 00:10:06.236
Domestic workers know that any time
a single person becomes disposable,